This is no longer possible.  I'm not sure exactly which patchlevel corrected
scroll of mail abuse, but in patchlevel nine it is impossible to create
blank scrolls by dipping a scroll of mail in either a potion of water or a
fountain.  It is similarly impossible to polymorph a scroll of mail into any
other type of scroll.  Your best bet is to just drop them - there really 
isn't any use for them other than cuteness.

